  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/00SN">Lemma <span data-tag="00SN">10.136.3</span>.</a> Any base change of a syntomic map is syntomic. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
